      "content": "it's just hard to swallow that \"letting go\" advice because it feels like it's just a way to numb the pain instead of actually facing the reality. like, if the future is just going to be chaos and suffering for everyone, why is there even a point to staying in the game? it feels like we're all just being forced to watch the tragedy unfold.",
